From: Uchio Kondo <udzura@udzura.jp>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:48:39 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Borrow String bytes in IO::Buffer.for blocks

Lock mutable String storage during the yield and release it on unwind.
Compare write-through, readonly views, and cleanup with CRuby.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
